# SplitWala — no API keys or credentials needed!
#
# whatsapp-web.js works by running a real WhatsApp Web session.
# You log in once by scanning a QR code in the terminal.
# Your session is then saved automatically in .wwebjs_auth/
# so you don't need to scan again on the next run.
#
# Optional: get a notification when the bot dies.
# 1. Sign up free at https://healthchecks.io
# 2. Create a check, set "Period" to 1 minute and "Grace" to 5 minutes
# 3. Add an integration (Email / Telegram / Discord / etc.)
# 4. Copy the unique check URL and paste it below
#
# HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/your-uuid-here
